{"overview":"سال‌ها پس از مرگ قهرمان مورد احترام، ماکسیموس، به دست عمویش، لوسیوس مجبور می‌شود وارد کولوسئوم شود، پس از اینکه خانه‌اش توسط امپراتوران ظالمی که اکنون با مشت آهنین بر روم حکومت می‌کنند، تسخیر می‌شود. با خشم در قلب و آینده امپراتوری در خطر، لوسیوس باید به گذشته خود نگاه کند تا قدرت و افتخار را بیابد و شکوه روم را به مردمش بازگرداند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.","tagline_en":"Prepare to be entertained.","runtime":141,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ریدلی اسکات"],"crew_en":["Ridley Scott"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"پل مسکال","role":"Lucius","photo":"/vrzZ41TGNAFgfmZjC2sOJySzBLd.jpg","en":"Paul Mescal"},{"name":"دنزل واشینگتن","role":"Macrinus","photo":"/jj2Gcobpopokal0YstuCQW0ldJ4.jpg","en":"Denzel Washington"},{"name":"پدرو پاسکال","role":"General Acacius","photo":"/oKcMbVn0NJTNzQt0ClKKvVXkm60.jpg","en":"Pedro Pascal"},{"name":"کانی نیلسن","role":"Lucilla","photo":"/gSQ3O3PJ6ly6nT63joOtfZyscFP.jpg","en":"Connie Nielsen"},{"name":"جوزف کوین","role":"Emperor Geta","photo":"/zshhuioZaH8S5ZKdMcojzWi1ntl.jpg","en":"Joseph Quinn"},{"name":"Fred Hechinger","role":"Emperor Caracalla","photo":"/nxQfwTWev2VzQJDdKHixPvwXiZS.jpg"},{"name":"لیور راز","role":"Viggo","photo":"/6uHFnt0iZtcdTOXAXThqfQhuG5T.jpg","en":"Lior Raz"},{"name":"درک جاکوبی","role":"Gracchus","photo":"/yHENzHZSVpnNrqsoATuDSMiQflf.jpg","en":"Derek Jacobi"},{"name":"پیتر منسا","role":"Jugurtha","photo":"/72L6LbeF5ZqRdLmhibNqysQNQRg.jpg","en":"Peter Mensah"},{"name":"Matt Lucas","role":"Master of Ceremonies","photo":"/2OhGLJqiknaWlbTkG2KDwT935km.jpg"},{"name":"Alexander Karim","role":"Ravi",